ZO_CreateStringId("ITR_INF", "[ItemTracker] Plugin for quick and convenient tracking of specific item farming,\nIf the plugin was very useful, you can write (In PM /t or /w) and send some gold to the author - @A5ha\n\nAvailable commands:\n/itr_add [link] - Add item tracker to screen (Draggable)\n/itr_del [link] - Remove item tracker from screen\n/itr_clr - Delete all plugin trackers\n\n*To drag trackers use Cursor (In control settings'Show/hide cursor')")
ZO_CreateStringId("ITR_CLR", "[ItemTracker] All trackers cleared!")
